STEP 1: Create the wallet with password
-----------------------------------------------------------------------
orapki wallet create -wallet /data/SIH/19.22.0/apiwallet/  -pwd xxxxxxx -auto_login
 
STEP 2 :Add Certificate to Wallet 
-----------------------------------------------------------------------
orapki wallet add -wallet /data/SIH/19.22.0/apiwallet -trusted_cert -cert "apisitgatewaylb.p7b" -pwd xxxxxxx
 
STEP 3: Verify wallet created and certificate imported 
-----------------------------------------------------------------------
orapki wallet display -wallet  data/PROD/19.0.0/apiwallet -pwd sitpasswd123
